<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112032" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φολίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>horny scale,</i> of reptiles, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπίς</span> (of fishes), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				490b22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				691a16
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.221
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				3.438
			</span></i>, Epic. ap. Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				257
			</span></i>; but interchanged with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπίς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				17.105
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. χαλκοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Vid.Ac.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>spot on a panther's</i> or <i>leopard's skin,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				10.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. λιθοκόλλητος</span>”
				<i>a ceiling in mosaic work,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					18.26
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> a
				<i>bandage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				48.20.11
			</span></i>.</div>
